    "detailed_description": "Weapons Arena is a 2D top-down turn-based strategy game. The core gameplay involves inflicting damage on enemies using firearms while simultaneously using the &quot;side effect&quot; of gunfire\u2014recoil\u2014to maneuver around the battlefield. Players need to carefully anticipate the chain reactions caused by each shot and strategically utilize the &quot;side effects&quot; to achieve their objectives. The game features a variety of levels, allowing players to explore different combinations of weapons and skills, and challenge themselves with distinctive combat styles. The simple core mechanics make it easy for players to pick up, while the extensive progression system outside of combat ensures that even casual players can enjoy the game. Additionally, extra objectives in levels offer greater rewards for players who enjoy strategic gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong></h2>Coupling of Attack and Movement: Every shot not only deals damage but also affects your positioning. Transparent Enemy Intentions: You can see and anticipate enemy moves, enabling strategic planning. Chess-like Turn-Based System: Movement and actions are executed one step at a time, similar to a board game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/448f71c5f198549948b98fcd7d1e78fe.poster.avif?t=1732637928\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/448f71c5f198549948b98fcd7d1e78fe.webm?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/448f71c5f198549948b98fcd7d1e78fe.mp4?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Variety of Enemies and Maps:</strong></h2>Observe, Understand, Outsmart: Analyze enemy behavior patterns, dodge attacks with precise positioning, and eliminate threats efficiently.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/c0998defb5fb81de78b3fa9637a0e0b8.poster.avif?t=1732637928\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/c0998defb5fb81de78b3fa9637a0e0b8.webm?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/c0998defb5fb81de78b3fa9637a0e0b8.mp4?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons and Skills:</h2></strong><br>Weapon and Skill Combinations: Experiment with different setups to discover various combat styles.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Levels with Diverse Objectives:</h2></strong><br>Multiple Mission Types: Objectives vary from eliminating all enemies to defending, hunting, holding positions, breaking through, and tackling challenging endgame scenarios.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/e0fba972e1495892edc9c5c413d835e3.poster.avif?t=1732637928\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/e0fba972e1495892edc9c5c413d835e3.webm?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169910/extras/e0fba972e1495892edc9c5c413d835e3.mp4?t=1732637928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
